# --- design references ---
# The design shots under DESIGNS/ are tracked and are the source of the visual
# direction. Installer binaries are not: DESIGNS/EpicInstaller-20.3.3.exe is
# 252 MB, which is larger than GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so a `git add -A`
# would stage it and then block EVERY future push until history was rewritten.
# Ignore the class rather than the single file, since the next download will
# land in the same place.
*.exe

# --- scratch ---
